meta {
  name: Create meal entry
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/meals/{{mealTypeId}}/entries
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "date": "{{date}}",
    "title": "Oatmeal with berries",
    "quantity": "250 g",
    "notes": "Made with milk",
    "calories": 380
  }
}

docs {
  Add a product to one of the signed-in user's meal categories for a date.

  Required fields: date (YYYY-MM-DD) and title. Quantity, notes, and nutrition details are optional.

  Example response (201):
  {
    "id": "b7906b25-4d20-465c-bbca-f5a922c4edb9",
    "productId": null,
    "title": "Oatmeal with berries",
    "quantity": "250 g",
    "notes": "Made with milk",
    "calories": 380,
    "createdAt": "2026-11-02T08:30:00.000Z"
  }

  The mealTypeId path parameter must belong to the signed-in user. Invalid input returns 400, a category that does not belong to the user returns 404, and an unauthenticated request returns 401.
}
